#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:3 33b5e8fcd01f47308740905a4dc47c96
msgid "Fedora templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:5 c60cb7091b0c4eb68826f08f220c31e6
msgid ""
"The Fedora Xfce :doc:`template </user/templates/templates>` is the default "
"template in Qubes OS. The current supported versions are :ref:`Fedora 43 and "
"Fedora 44 <user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-"
"releases:Templates>`. **This page is about the \"full\" Fedora templates** "
"(with a name ending in ``-43``, ``-xfce`` or ``-gnome``). For the minimal "
"version, please see the :doc:`Minimal templates </user/templates/minimal-"
"templates>` page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:7 e7b3edf909964dd98f285e715f07c2ec
msgid "4.3 and Fedora 44"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:9 36475fc54abe46e784ed1330842cf074
msgid ""
"Starting with Fedora 44 (in Qubes 4.3), the Gnome template is "
"named :samp:`fedora-{XX}-gnome` where :samp:`{XX}` is the version number. It "
"was previously named :samp:`fedora-{XX}`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:12
#: fd58ec0d8925406eafca8329e3c19068
msgid "Installing"
msgstr ""

