#: e1557fd3f0004d25b30442bd52e720fa
msgid ""
"To :ref:`install <user/templates/templates:installing>` a specific Fedora "
"template that is not currently installed in your system, use the Qubes "
"Template Manager, or use the following command in a dom0 terminal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:23
#: 364c4b333f7d4df49b45dd106bad7cee
msgid ""
"(Replace :samp:`fedora-{XX}` with the name of the Fedora template you wish "
"to install.)"
msgstr ""

